# Generated AI-context artefacts.
#
# These six files are written wholesale by `pnpm --filter @we/ai-context generate-context` from
# `packages/ai-context/src/fragments/` plus the registries it reads. They are committed because the
# tools that consume them read the repository — Claude Code reads CLAUDE.md, Cursor reads the rule
# file, Copilot reads its instructions — so a build artefact is exactly what they need to find.
#
# Committing them makes them a conflict magnet. Any two branches that add a component, a store
# member, an expression function or a token touch all six, and the audit of 2026-09-05 found that
# they were the *only* thing two live feature branches collided on. Resolving that by hand means
# reading a three-way diff of a 336 KB generated file, where the correct answer is never "pick a
# side" — it is "regenerate".
#
# So: take one side automatically and regenerate afterwards. `merge=we-generated` is registered by
# `scripts/install-merge-driver.mjs`, which `pnpm prepare` runs on install. A clone that has not run
# install falls back to an ordinary conflict, which is the safe direction.
#
# The backstop is CI, not this file: the Build job runs `pnpm build` and then fails if the tree is
# dirty, so a merge that left these stale is caught before review rather than after.
#
# `-diff` keeps them out of diff output, where 336 KB of regenerated prose buries the change that
# actually needs reading.
CLAUDE.md                             merge=we-generated -diff linguist-generated
AGENTS.md                             merge=we-generated -diff linguist-generated
.github/copilot-instructions.md       merge=we-generated -diff linguist-generated
.cursor/rules/we-schema.mdc           merge=we-generated -diff linguist-generated
packages/ai-context/context.json      merge=we-generated -diff linguist-generated
packages/schema-system/shared/src/generated/contextData.ts  merge=we-generated -diff linguist-generated

# The lockfile is generated too, and has the same "never merge by hand" property.
pnpm-lock.yaml                        -diff linguist-generated
